0..77 Comment "// State\'s models over host types. `get`\'s continuation binds the state, so a"
78..147 Comment "// model gives it the thunked function from the state to the carrier,"
148..220 Comment "// `+U (S -> -F C)`: in the standard model of a second-order signature a"
221..285 Comment "// representable sort\'s binder is an exponential (Fiore and Hur,"
286..356 Comment "// _Second-Order Equational Logic_, CSL 2010). The model here is state"
357..434 Comment "// passing, the carrier a function of the current state. A law relating terms"
435..513 Comment "// at `get`\'s port is a path between host functions, which the derivation does"
514..590 Comment "// not state yet: `../../pathological/effects/state-model.gandr`. A model is"
591..667 Comment "// a record, so one carried along an equivalence of states is a model again,"
668..711 Comment "// its `get` conjugated by the equivalence."
713..755 Comment "// The theories `State` and `StatePutPut`."
